  "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Update the release runbook for the new timeout**\n\nWith this job now allowed to run for 90 minutes, `docs/agent/RELEASE_READINESS.md:397-400` still tells operators that the regression job and its test execution limit are 60 minutes. During the documented timing-failure recovery procedure, a valid run in the new 60–90 minute window can therefore be mistaken for an overdue run; update both timeout references together with this workflow setting.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
